<title>NETHERLANDS: ING Barings raises Elsevier to Buy.</title>
<headline>ING Barings raises Elsevier to Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Research note summary (25/06)</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Elsevier	  Publishing     32.20  ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: Recommendation raised to Buy from Hold due to 1997 acquisition successes and shares' strong underperformance. Price of $447 million paid for Chilton Business Group attractive. Buy seen producing cost savings, enhancing earnings.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     pvs EPS   P/E    P/CF   Dividend</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)	1.13		 28.5	     0.76</p>
<p>    1997		   1.37    1.37     23.5</p>
<p>    1998		   1.53    1.51     21.0</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
